<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"># [&#39;小明&#39;, &#39;硕士&#39;, &#39;毕业&#39;, &#39;于&#39;, &#39;中国科学院&#39;, &#39;计算所&#39;]</span></span>
